IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPARQ-ULTRA-V12.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-SUBBANDS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 THRESH-PCT          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SNR-DB              PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100 PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPARQ-V12.
    IF NUM-SUBBANDS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 58 TO SNR-DB.
    MOVE 540 TO SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-SUBBANDS.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
